  {"g3:082a49e9", "My POKéMON can't be taken down\\neasily!", "Meu POKéMON nÃo será derrotado\\nfácil!"},
  {"g3:082a4a10", "You're kidding!\\nExplain how I lost!", "Que? Como?\\nExplique como eu perdi!"},
  {"g3:082a4a34", "Haha!\\nYou won, all right!\\n\\nI'll work my way back up by taking on\\nTRAINERS I happen to meet!", "Haha!\\nVocê ganhou, tudo bem!\\n\\nVou fazer meu caminho de volta\\nbatalhando com quem encontrar!"},
  {"g3:082a4a8f", "Listen, have you seen another SAILOR\\naround here?", "Diga-me, tem visto algum outro\\nMARINHEIRO por ai?"},
  {"g3:082a4ac1", "Now, that's something!", "Ok, você nao viu nada..."},
  {"g3:082a4ad8", "Our boat drifted out to sea.\\n\\nMy buddy's a timid fellow, so I'm\\nworried about him.", "A maré levou o nosso barco.\\n\\nMeu companheiro é tÍmido,\\npor isso estou preocupado."},
  {"g3:082a4b33", "REPEL's effect wore off...", "REPELENTE passou efeito..."},
  {"g3:082a4bf4", "Would you like to exit the SAFARI\\nZONE right now?", "Você realmente deseja sair\\nda ZONA SAFARI agora?"},
  {"g3:082a4c26", "Ding-dong! Time's up!\\nYour SAFARI Game is over.", "Ding-dong! O tempo acabou!\\nSeu SAFARI terminou."},
  {"g3:082a4c56", "You've run out of SAFARI BALLS.\\nYour SAFARI Game is over.", "Você ficou sem SAFARI BOLAS.\\n...Seu SAFARI termina aqui."},
  {"g3:082a4c90", "Would you like to place a POKéBLOCK\\non the POKéBLOCK FEEDER?", "Quer colocar um POKéBLOCK\\nno COMEDOR de POKéBLOCKS?"},
  {"g3:082a4cc5", "The {02} you left\\nbefore is still here.", "A {02} que você deixou\\nainda está aqui."},
  {"g3:082a4ceb", "The {02} was placed\\non the POKéBLOCK FEEDER.", "Foi colocado um {02}\\nno COMEDOR de POKéBLOCK"},
  {"g3:082a4d12", "Welcome to the SAFARI ZONE!\\n\\nHere, you may witness many kinds of\\nPOKéMON rarely seen in HOENN.\\n\\nAnd, you'll see them in their wild,\\nuntamed state in natural habitats.\\n\\nWhat's more, we've thrown open the\\ngates to POKéMON TRAINERS.\\n\\nYou're encouraged to catch POKéMON\\nfor keeps!\\n\\nCome in and enjoy the SAFARI ZONE!", "Olá! Está é a ZONA SAFARI!\\n\\nAqui você pode ver muitos tipos de\\nPOKéMON raramente visto em HOENN.\\n\\nE, você vai vê-los em sua natureza,\\nindomável em seus habitats naturais.\\n\\nE tem mais, abrimos as portas\\npara TREINADORES POKéMON.\\n\\nVocê é encorajado a capturar\\nPOKéMON para valer!\\n\\nVenha e desfrute da ZONA SAFARI!"},
  {"g3:082a4e46", "Welcome to the SAFARI ZONE!\\nIs it your first time here?", "Olá! Está e a ZONA SAFARI!\\nÉ a sua primeira vez aqui?"},
  {"g3:082a4e7e", "Come in and enjoy the SAFARI ZONE!", "Venha e desfrute da ZONA SAFARI!"},
  {"g3:082a4ea1", "When you enter the SAFARI ZONE, you\\nstart with 30 SAFARI BALLS for\\n\\ncatching POKéMON.\\n\\nThe SAFARI Game is over when you run\\nout of SAFARI BALLS, or when you've\\n\\nwalked 500 steps.\\n\\nCome in and enjoy the SAFARI ZONE!", "Quando você entra na ZONA SAFARI,\\nvocê começar com 30 SAFARI BOLAS\\n\\npara pegar POKéMON.\\n\\nO SAFARI acaba quando você joga\\ntodas as SAFARI BOLAS, ou quando\\n\\nvocê caminhar 500 passos.\\n\\nVenha e desfrute da ZONA SAFARI!"},
  {"g3:082a4f74", "Welcome to the SAFARI ZONE!\\n\\nAll you can catch for just $500!\\nWould you like to play a SAFARI Game?", "Olá! Está é a ZONA SAFARI!\\n\\nCapture tudo que pode só por $500!\\nGostaria de brincar na ZONA SAFARI?"},
  {"g3:082a4fd7", "Okay.\\nPlease play another time!", "NÃo tem problema.\\nVolte depois."},
  {"g3:082a4ff7", "You don't have enough money.\\nSorry.", "NÃo tem dinheiro suficiente.\\nOooh...!"},
  {"g3:082a501b", "That will be $500, please.", "SÃo $500, por favor."},
  {"g3:082a5036", "Here are your SAFARI BALLS.", "Aqui as suas SAFARI BOLAS."},
  {"g3:082a5052", "{01} received 30 SAFARI BALLS.", "{01} recebeu 30 SAFARI BOLAS."},
  {"g3:082a506f", "We'll let you know when your game\\nis over.\\n\\nSo, until then, enjoy yourself, please!\\nOff you go on your wild excursion!", "Nós vamos te avisar quando\\no seu tempo terminar.\\n\\nAté entÃo, divirta-se, por favor!\\nSaia em sua excursÃo selvagem."},
  {"g3:082a50e5", "Excuse me!\\nYour PC BOX is full.", "Excuse me!\\nYour PC BOX is full."},
  {"g3:082a5105", "Excuse me!\\nYou seem to be without a POKéBLOCK CASE.\\n\\nYour SAFARI Game will be much more\\nfruitful if you use POKéBLOCKS.\\n\\nPlease come back with a POKéBLOCK CASE.\\n\\nYou may obtain a POKéBLOCK CASE from\\nthe LILYCOVE CONTEST HALL.", "Desculpe-me!\\nMas...\\n\\nVocê parece nÃo ter POKéBLOCK .\\n\\nSua caçada no SAFARI será muito mais\\nfrutÍfera se tiver POKéBLOCK.\\n\\nPor favor, volte com as POKéBLOCK.\\n\\nVocê pode obter uma POKéBLOCK lá no\\nCONCURSO MUNICIPAL de LILYCOVE."},
  {"g3:082a51d4", "You still have time left. Would you like\\nto exit the SAFARI ZONE now?", "Você ainda tem tempo de sobra. Quer\\nsair da ZONA SAFARI agora mesmo?"},
  {"g3:082a521a", "Please enjoy the rest of your wild\\nadventure!", "Por favor, aproveite o resto\\nde sua aventura!"},
  {"g3:082a5248", "Okay.\\n\\nI'll take back your remaining SAFARI\\nBALLS.\\n\\nThank you for playing.\\nWe hope to see you again.", "Muito bem.\\n\\nEu vou recolher as SAFARI BOLAS\\nrestantes.\\n\\nObrigado por jogar.\\nVolte sempre que quiser."},
  {"g3:082a52ab", "Good luck!\\n\\nIf you need anything, don't hesitate\\nto tell me, please!", "Boa sorte!\\n\\nSe precisar de algo, nÃo hesite,\\nme diga, de acordo?"},
  {"g3:082a52ef", "Did you know?\\n\\nIf you put a POKéBLOCK in that square box,\\nPOKéMON gather around.", "Você sabia?\\n\\nSe colocar um POKéBLOCK nessa caixa,\\natraÍra muitos POKéMON."},
  {"g3:082a533b", "I want to keep going deeper, but I\\nforgot to bring a BIKE.\\n\\nSomething tells me that rare POKéMON\\nlive in the outlying areas.", "Eu quero continuar adiante,\\nmas eu esqueci minha BIKE.\\n\\nTenho a sensaçÃo de que as\\nzonas mais distantes vivem\\n\\nPOKéMON raros."},
  {"g3:082a53b7", "Sometimes, when I toss a POKéBLOCK at \\nPOKéMON, it gets ignored.\\n\\nDo POKéMON have likes and dislikes\\nabout what they eat?", "Às vezes, quando lanço um POKéBLOCK\\na um POKéMON, ele ignora.\\n\\nOs POKéMON também tem gostos\\ne preferências com a comida?"},
  {"g3:082a542c", "Gasp... Gasp...\\nI...made it out here...but...\\n\\nI'm exhausted... I don't have the\\nenergy to catch POKéMON...", "Gasp... Gasp...\\nEu...cheguei até... aqui...\\n\\nEstou exausto... Eu nÃo tenho\\nforças para capturar POKéMON..."},
  {"g3:082a5489", "I'm on a mission to find WATER POKéMON\\nyou don't see in HOENN.\\n\\nDo you have any idea where the lake is?", "Estou em uma missÃo para encontrar\\nPOKéMON raros do tipo ÁGUA.\\n\\nVocê sabe aonde fica o lago?"},
  {"g3:082a54f0", "I'm going to catch a lot of rare POKéMON\\nhere and trade them with my friends!", "Vou capturar um monte de POKéMON\\nraros para trocá-los com meus amigos!"},
  {"g3:082a553e", "I put a POKéBLOCK on the POKéBLOCK FEEDER.\\nBut it seems to have disappeared.\\n\\nI guess POKéMON must have eaten it\\nwithout me noticing.", "Eu coloque um POKéBLOCK no COMEDOR\\nde POKéBLOCK, mas desapareceu.\\n\\nAcho que algum POKéMON deve\\nter comido sem eu notar."},
  {"g3:082a55bb", "SAFARI ZONE TRAINER TIP!\\n\\nThrow POKéBLOCKS at wild POKéMON to make\\nthem less likely to flee.", "ZONA SAFARI DICAS ÚTEIS!\\n\\nJogue POKéBLOCK em POKéMON selvagens\\npara que eles escapem menos."},
  {"g3:082a5613", "«Relieve your tired feet.»\\nREST HOUSE", "POUSADA\\n«Alivie seus pés cansados.»"},
  {"g3:082a5639", "I don't have any POKéBLOCKS, but I caught\\na good number of POKéMON.\\n\\nYou can improve your chances of making\\na catch by getting closer to them\\n\\nbefore throwing a SAFARI BALL.", "NÃo tenho nenhum POKéBLOCK, mas\\neu capturei bastantes POKéMON.\\n\\nVocê pode melhorar suas chances de\\ncapturar chegando o mais perto deles\\n\\nantes de lançar uma SAFARI BOLA."},
  {"g3:082a56e1", "If you use POKéBLOCKS, wild POKéMON won't\\nbe so quick to run away.\\n\\nIt's not much use to give POKéBLOCKS to\\nPOKéMON that don't flee easily.", "Se usar POKéBLOCKS, os POKéMON\\nselvagens nÃo escaparam tÃo rápido.\\n\\nMas nÃo vale a pena dar POKéBLOCKS aos\\nPOKéMON que sÃo mais mansos..."},
  {"g3:082a5764", "If you put a POKéBLOCK on the FEEDER,\\nPOKéMON are attracted to it.\\n\\nI think POKéMON with the same sort of\\nnature are drawn by a certain POKéBLOCK.", "Se colocar um POKéBLOCK no COMEDOR\\nde POKéBLOCKS, atraÍra POKéMON.\\n\\nAcho que os POKéMON que possui\\na mesma natureza gosta do mesmo\\n\\ntipo de POKéBLOCK."},
  {"g3:082a57ee", "This area is still under construction.\\nIt's off-limits, sorry!", "Esta área está em construçÃo.\\nEstá fora dos limites, desculpe!"},
  {"g3:082a582d", "The SAFARI ZONE's expansion project\\nis finished now.\\n\\nWe hope you will enjoy the new area.", "Já foi concluÍdo o projeto de\\nampliaçÃo da ZONA SAFARI.\\n\\nEspero que aproveite a nova área."},
  {"g3:082a5887", "This area is still under construction.\\nIt's off-limits, sorry!", "Esta área está em construçÃo.\\nEstá fora dos limites, desculpe!"},
  {"g3:082a58c6", "Wow! Whee! I haven't seen any of\\nthese POKéMON before!", "Uau! Eh! Eu nunca vi nenhum\\ndeste POKéMON antes!"},
  {"g3:082a58fd", "The POKéMON in this area are all\\nnew to me.\\n\\nAnd I'm allowed to catch these rare\\nPOKéMON! Too cool!", "Os POKéMON nesta área sÃo\\ntodos novos para mim.\\n\\nE tenho permissÃo para capturá-los!\\nQue sorte!"},
  {"g3:082a5960", "The POKéMON around here seem to be\\nfrom somewhere other than HOENN.", "Os POKéMON que há por aqui\\nnÃo parecem ser de HOENN."},
  {"g3:082a59a4", "I only have a couple SAFARI BALLS left.\\n\\nI'm having a hard time trying to\\ndecide what I should catch.", "Eu só tenho 2 SAFARI BOLAS.\\n\\nEu estou tendo dificuldades em \\ndecidir qual capturo e qual nÃo."},
  {"g3:082a5a09", "I heard that you can see PIKACHU here.\\nWhere might one be?", "Ouvi dizer que há PIKACHU por aqui.\\nAonde podem estar?"},
  {"g3:082a5a44", "Oh, boo!\\nI can't seem to catch anything!\\n\\nI'll end up wasting the admission\\nprice if I don't catch something!", "Poxa!\\nNÃo consigo capturar nada!\\n\\nEu vou acabar perdendo o valor que\\npaguei, se nÃo capturar nenhum!"},
  {"g3:082a5c9c", "PROF. BIRCH: Ah, {01}{05}!\\n\\nAre you curious about how your\\nPOKéDEX is coming along?", "PROF. BIRCH: Ah, {01}{05}!\\n\\nVocê gostaria de saber como  \\na sua POKéDEX está agora?"},
  {"g3:082a5ceb", "Hm? Oh, you haven't caught enough\\nPOKéMON to make it worthwhile.", "Hm? Você nÃo pegou POKéMON o suficiente\\npara fazer valer a pena."},
  {"g3:082a5d2c", "Hmhm...\\n\\nSo, you've seen {02} POKéMON,\\nand you've caught {03} POKéMON...", "Hmhm...\\n\\nEntÃo, você já viu {02} POKéMON,  \\ne você pegou {03} POKéMON..."},
  {"g3:082a633d", "Hmhm...\\nOn a nationwide basis...\\n\\nYou've seen {02} POKéMON,\\nand you've caught {03} POKéMON...", "Hmhm...\\nEm âmbito nacional...\\n\\nVocê já viu {02} POKéMON,\\ne você pegou {03} POKéMON..."},
  {"g3:082a6390", "This is the POKéMON LOTTERY CORNER.\\n\\nAll shoppers at our DEPARTMENT STORE\\nget to draw a POKéMON LOTO TICKET.\\n\\nIf the LOTO TICKET's number matches\\nthe ID number of any of your POKéMON,\\n\\nyou will receive a fabulous gift.\\n\\nWould you like to draw a POKéMON\\nLOTO TICKET?", "Esta é a  LOTERIA POKéMON.\\n\\nTodos os compradores em nossa lojas\\npodem tirar um BILHETE LOTÉRICO.\\n\\nSe o número do BILHETE coincide com\\no número de identificaçÃo de qualquer\\n\\num dos seus POKéMON, você receberá\\n\\num presente fabuloso.\\n\\nGostaria de tirar um BILHETE?"},
  {"g3:082a6496", "Please come back tomorrow.", "Por favor, volte amanhÃ."},
  {"g3:082a64b1", "Please do visit again.", "Ok, depois outra hora!"},
  {"g3:082a64c8", "Please pick a LOTO TICKET.\\n.........", "Por favor gerando BILHETE.\\n........."},
  {"g3:082a650b", "The LOTO TICKET number is {02}.\\n\\nI need to run a check on this number\\nto see if it matches any of your\\n\\nPOKéMON's ID numbers. Please wait.", "O número do BILHETE é {02}.\\n\\nEu preciso executar uma verificaçÃo\\nsobre este número para ver se ele\\n\\ncorresponde. Por favor, aguarde..."},
  {"g3:082a6592", "Congratulations!\\n\\nThe ID number of your team's\\n{02} matches your\\n\\nLOTO TICKET's number!", "Congratulations!\\n\\nThe ID number of your team's\\n{02} matches your\\n\\nLOTO TICKET's number!"},
  {"g3:082a65e6", "Congratulations!\\n\\nThe ID number of your PC-boxed\\n{02} matches your\\n\\nLOTO TICKET's number!", "Congratulations!\\n\\nThe ID number of your PC-boxed\\n{02} matches your\\n\\nLOTO TICKET's number!"},
  {"g3:082a663c", "I'm sorry.\\nNone of the numbers matched.", "Desculpe-me.\\nNenhum número corresponde."},
  {"g3:082a6664", "Two digits matched, so you win the\\nthird prize!\\n\\nYou've won the {02}!", "Two digits matched, so you win the\\nthird prize!\\n\\nYou've won the {02}!"},
  {"g3:082a66a7", "Three digits matched, so you win the\\nsecond prize!\\n\\nYou've won the {02}!", "Three digits matched, so you win the\\nsecond prize!\\n\\nYou've won the {02}!"},
  {"g3:082a66ed", "Four digits matched, so you win the\\nfirst prize!\\n\\nYou've won the {02}!", "Four digits matched, so you win the\\nfirst prize!\\n\\nYou've won the {02}!"},
  {"g3:082a6731", "Oh, my goodness, all five digits\\nmatched!\\n\\nYou've won the jackpot prize!\\nYou've won the {02}!", "Oh, my goodness, all five digits\\nmatched!\\n\\nYou've won the jackpot prize!\\nYou've won the {02}!"},
  {"g3:082a678c", "Oh?\\nYou seem to have no room for this.\\n\\nPlease make room in your BAG and\\nlet me know.", "Oh?\\nYou seem to have no room for this.\\n\\nPlease make room in your BAG and\\nlet me know."},
  {"g3:082a67e1", "{01}?\\nYes, I've been expecting you.\\n\\nThis is the prize we've been holding\\nfor you.", "{01}?\\nYes, I've been expecting you.\\n\\nThis is the prize we've been holding\\nfor you."},
  {"g3:082a6831", "Please do visit again.", "Visite em outra hora."},
  {"g3:082a6848", "The ferry to SLATEPORT is...\\n\\nI beg your pardon?\\nCan we sail to this place on the map?\\n\\nI know someone who will help you better.\\nPlease wait.", "The ferry to SLATEPORT is...\\n\\nI beg your pardon?\\nCan we sail to this place on the map?\\n\\nI know someone who will help you better.\\nPlease wait."},
  {"g3:082a68d2", "The ferry to SLATEPORT is...\\n\\nOh?\\nThat PASS...", "The ferry to SLATEPORT is...\\n\\nOh?\\nThat PASS..."},
  {"g3:082a68fc", "Aye, mate, are you the one who brought\\nthat mighty odd PASS?\\n\\nI'll tell you, you're trying to reach a\\ntiny spit of an island far in the south.\\n\\nThere's no telling what we'll encounter\\nonce we reach there, aye.\\n\\nThat shivers my timbers!\\n\\nAll aboard!", "Aye, mate, are you the one who brought\\nthat mighty odd PASS?\\n\\nI'll tell you, you're trying to reach a\\ntiny spit of an island far in the south.\\n\\nThere's no telling what we'll encounter\\nonce we reach there, aye.\\n\\nThat shivers my timbers!\\n\\nAll aboard!"},
  {"g3:082a69f1", "Aye, mate, there's nothing here to\\nsee or do on this forgettable island.\\n\\nWhat say we sail back to LILYCOVE?", "Aye, mate, there's nothing here to\\nsee or do on this forgettable island.\\n\\nWhat say we sail back to LILYCOVE?"},
  {"g3:082a6a5d", "Aye, right, then!\\nSail home we will!", "Aye, right, then!\\nSail home we will!"},
  {"g3:082a6a82", "Aye, right, as you like, then.", "Aye, right, as you like, then."},
  {"g3:082a6aa1", "«All dreams are but another reality.\\nNever forget...»", "«All dreams are but another reality.\\nNever forget...»"},
  {"g3:082a6ad5", "«Those whose memories fade seek to\\ncarve them in their hearts...»", "«Those whose memories fade seek to\\ncarve them in their hearts...»"},
  {"g3:082a6d3d", "DAD: Hi, {01}!\\n\\nI just received a very rare BERRY.\\nI'd like you to have it.", "DAD: Hi, {01}!\\n\\nI just received a very rare BERRY.\\nI'd like you to have it."},
  {"g3:082a6d86", "If you see BERRIES growing in loamy\\nsoil, feel free to take them.\\n\\nBut make sure you plant a BERRY in the\\nsame spot. That's common courtesy.\\n\\nHere, I'll share this with you.", "Se você ver FRUTOS crescendo em \\nárvores, sinta-se livre para pegá-los.\\n\\nMas plante um FRUTO no mesmo local.\\nBem... isso é uma cortesia comum.\\n\\nAqui, você pode ficar com isso!"},
  {"g3:082a6e32", "The way you look, you must be a\\nTRAINER, no?\\n\\nTRAINERS often make POKéMON hold\\nBERRIES.\\n\\nIt's up to you whether to grow BERRIES\\nor use them.", "Oh, você deve ser um TREINADOR?\\n\\nTREINADORES oferecem FRUTOS\\npara que os POKéMON segurem.\\n\\nÉ você que decide cultivar\\nou utilizar os FRUTOS!"},
  {"g3:082a6ebd", "I watered the plants every day.\\nThey grew lots of flowers.\\n\\nAnd they gave me lots of BERRIES, too.\\n\\nHere you go!\\nYou can have it!", "Eu regava as plantas todos os dias.\\nAi, cresceram muitas flores.\\n\\nE me renderam muitos FRUTOS.\\n\\nJá tenho muito!\\nVocê pode levar."},
  {"g3:082a6f3d", "I'm going to try really hard and make\\nBERRIES in different colors.\\n\\nI hope you try hard, too!", "Sabe... Eu vou tentar fazer   \\nFRUTOS em cores diferentes.\\n\\nEu espero que você tente, também!"},
  {"g3:082a6f9a", "I wonder what color BERRIES I'll look\\nfor today?", "Hm... Qual cor de FRUTOS\\neu vou tentar fazer hoje?"},
  {"g3:082a6fcb", "I love using the BERRY CRUSH machine,\\nso I'm collecting BERRIES.\\n\\nI'll share one with you, if you'd like.", "Gosto muito de usar a máquina\\nPROCESSADOR...\\n\\nEu estou coletando FRUTOS.\\n\\nEu vou te dar um, se você gostar."},
  {"g3:082a7034", "You should try the BERRY CRUSH\\nmachine with your friends.", "Você deve tentar fazer alguns\\n«DOCES» com os seus amigos."},
  {"g3:082a706e", "Which BERRY should be planted?\\nShould you use or hoard BERRIES?\\n\\nIt's fun to think about.", "Qual FRUTO deve ser plantado?\\nSe você usa ou guarda os FRUTOS?\\n\\nÉ divertido pensar nisso."},
  {"g3:082a70c7", "BERRIES grow by soaking up sunlight.\\n\\nWe help the BERRIES grow by watering\\nthem regularly.\\n\\nIt's an expression of love, isn't it?", "Os FRUTOS crescem absorvendo\\nluz solar.\\n\\nNós ajudamos os FRUTOS crescer\\nREGANDO regularmente.\\n\\nÉ uma EXPRESSÃO de AMOR, nÃo acha?"},
  {"g3:082a7147", "Yes, yes.\\nYou understand what I mean.\\n\\nYou should take this.", "SIM!\\n\\nVocê entende o que eu quero dizer.\\n\\nOk, fique com isto."},
  {"g3:082a7183", "Oh... But it is important to make your\\nown impressions, I guess...\\n\\nYou can have this.", "Oh... É mais importante fazer suas\\npróprias EXPRESSÖES, eu acho...\\n\\nTome, um presente."},
  {"g3:082a71d5", "I think that BERRY is rare.\\nI hope you raise it with loving care.", "Eu acho que FRUTOS é coisa rara.\\nCom carinho, eu espero crescer."},
  {"g3:082a7217", "I'll get more BERRIES from\\nthe BERRY MASTER.", "Eu vou pegar mais FRUTOS\\ncom o MESTRE FRUTO."},
  {"g3:082a7244", "When it gets right down to it...\\n\\nThe same way suits suit me perfectly,\\na crisp breeze suits the sea.\\n\\nAnd you, a BERRY suits you to a «T»...\\n\\nWhy should that be so?", "Quando você pensa...\\n\\nIgual uma roupa que te sinta bem a brisa\\nmarÍtima refresca a dor de cabeça...\\n\\nUm FRUTO também...\\nte faz sentir-se bem.\\n\\nE por que isso é assim?"},
  {"g3:082a72e3", "When it gets right down to it...\\n\\nIt's because you're a TRAINER!", "Quando você pensa...\\n\\nDeve ser porque você já é um TREINADOR!"},
  {"g3:082a7321", "When it gets right down to it...\\n\\nThe way dignified simplicity suits me,\\nPOKéBLOCKS perfectly suit POKéMON.", "Quando você pensa...\\n\\nIgual sentir-se bem no ar de\\nhumidade, os POKéBLOCKS sentem\\n\\na morte pelos POKéMON."},
  {"g3:082a7386", "You may call me the BERRY MASTER.\\n\\nI dream of filling the world with\\nbeautiful flowers, so I raise BERRIES\\n\\nand hand them out to everyone.\\n\\nYou're deserving of one!", "Você pode me chamar de\\nMESTRE FRUTO.\\n\\nMeu sonho é encher o mundo com\\nbelas flores, entÃo eu compartilho\\n\\nFRUTOS para todos plantarem.\\n\\nVocê está merecendo ter um!"},
  {"g3:082a7428", "Why be stingy?\\nTake another!", "Serei bonzinho.\\nLeve outro!"},
  {"g3:082a7445", "Be sure to visit the PRETTY PETAL\\nflower shop near RUSTBORO.\\n\\nLet flowers fill the world!", "NÃo deixe de visitar a FLORICULTURA\\nperto de RUSTBORO.\\n\\nVamos encher o mundo de flores."},
  {"g3:082a749e", "I'm done for today.\\nCome again another day.\\n\\nLet flowers fill the world!", "Acabou por hoje!?\\nVenha novamente outro dia.\\n\\nEncha o mundo com flores."},
  {"g3:082a74e6", "The way my husband grows BERRIES,\\noh, he's the best in the world.\\n\\nHe makes me proud, that he does.\\n\\nIncidentally, child, have you heard\\na good saying lately?", "O meu marido cultiva FRUTOS faz tempo,\\nele é o melhor do mundo.\\n\\nEle me deixa orgulhosa, com o que faz.\\n\\nAliás, você ouviu algum   \\nbom fuxico ultimamente?"},
  {"g3:082a7583", "Ah! What a remarkable saying!\\nInspirational, it is!\\n\\nI want you to have this.", "Ah! What a remarkable saying!\\nInspirational, it is!\\n\\nI want you to have this."},
  {"g3:082a75d0", "Oh! A good saying it is.\\nYou're quite remarkable.\\n\\nI want you to have this.", "Oh! Um bom fuxico.\\nVocê é bastante notável.\\n\\nEu quero que você tenha isso."},
  {"g3:082a761b", "Our four grandchildren should become\\nmore accomplished than my husband.\\n\\nJoy never goes out of my life!", "Meus 4 netos devem ficar muito   \\nmais realizado do que meu marido.\\n\\nAlegria nunca sai da minha vida!"},
  {"g3:082a7682", "Ah...", "Ah..."},
  {"g3:082a7686", "Hello!\\n\\nThis is the PRETTY PETAL flower shop.\\nSpreading flowers all over the world!", "Olá!\\n\\nEsta é a FLORICULTURA flores de pétalia.\\nEspalhando lindas flores pelo mundo!"},
  {"g3:082a76d9", "{01}{05}, would you like to learn about\\nBERRIES?", "{01}{05}, gostaria de aprender sobre\\nFRUTOS??"},
  {"g3:082a7706", "Your name is?\\n\\n{01}{05}.\\nThat's a nice name.\\n\\n{01}{05}, would you like to learn about\\nBERRIES?", "Seu nome é?\\n\\n{01}{05}.\\nÈ um lindo nome.\\n\\n{01}{05}, gostaria de aprender sobre\\nFRUTOS??"},
  {"g3:082a775b", "BERRIES grow on trees that thrive\\nonly in soft, loamy soil.\\n\\nIf you take some BERRIES, be sure to\\nplant one in the loamy soil again.\\n\\nA planted BERRY will soon sprout,\\ngrow into a plant, flower beautifully,\\n\\nthen grow BERRIES again.\\n\\nI want to see the whole wide world\\nfilled with beautiful flowers.\\n\\nThat's my dream.\\n\\nPlease help me, {01}{05}. Plant BERRIES\\nand bring more flowers into the world.", "FRUTOS cresce em árvores que prosperam\\nsó em solo suave e argiloso.\\n\\nSe você tem FRUTOS, apenas plante\\nem solo suave e argiloso novamente.\\n\\nUm FRUTO plantado logo brota,\\ne cresce uma planta, de flor linda,\\n\\nentÃo crescem FRUTOS novamente.\\n\\nEu quero ver o mundo inteiro cheio de\\nbelas flores.\\n\\nEsse é o meu sonho!!\\n\\nPor favor me ajude, {01}{05}.\\nPlante os FRUTOS e traga mais flores\\n\\npara o mundo."},
  {"g3:082a78df", "Flowers bring so much happiness to\\npeople, don't they?", "As flores trazem felicidade para\\nas pessoas, nÃo acha?"},
  {"g3:082a7916", "Hello!\\n\\nThe more attention you give to flowers,\\nthe more beautifully they bloom.\\n\\nYou'll like tending flowers. I'm sure\\nof it. You can have this.", "Veja!\\n\\nQuanto mais atençÃo você dá as flores,\\nmais bonita elas florescem.\\n\\nVocê vai gostar das flores.\\nTenho certeza disso.\\n\\nVocê pode levar isso!"},
  {"g3:082a79a6", "While BERRY plants are growing,\\nwater them with the WAILMER PAIL.\\n\\nOh, another thing.\\n\\nIf you don't pick BERRIES for a while,\\nthey'll drop off onto the ground.\\n\\nBut they'll sprout again.\\n\\nIsn't that awesome?\\nIt's like they have the will to live.", "Enquanto as plantas estÃo crescendo,\\nregue-as com o REGADOR.\\n\\nOh, outra coisa.\\n\\nSe você nÃo colher os FRUTOS em um\\ntempo, eles vÃo cair no chÃo.\\n\\nMas, eles vÃo brotar novamente.\\n\\nBem... Isso nÃo é incrÍvel?\\nÉ como se eles tivesse vontade de viver."},
  {"g3:082a7a98", "I'm trying to be like my big sisters.\\nI'm growing flowers, too!\\n\\nHere you go!\\nIt's for you!", "Estou tentando ser como minhas irmÃs.  \\nEstou cultivando flores, também.\\n\\nIsso é para você!"},
  {"g3:082a7af3", "You can plant a BERRY and grow it big,\\nor you can make a POKéMON hold it.\\n\\nBut now they have a machine that mixes\\nup different BERRIES and makes candies\\n\\nfor POKéMON.\\n\\nI want some candy, too.", "Você pode plantar um FRUTO,\\npara ele crescer ou pode fazer\\n\\num POKéMON segurar.\\n\\nMas tem uma máquina que mistura\\ndiferentes FRUTOS e faz doces\\n\\npara os POKéMON.\\n\\nEu quero algums DOCES, também!"},
  {"g3:082a7bb0", "Hi, what's your name?\\n\\n... ... ...  ... ... ...  ... ... ...\\nOkay. That's nice!\\n\\nMy name is KIRI.\\n\\nMy mommy and daddy named me that so\\nI would grow healthy and warmhearted.\\n\\nThat's what they wished.\\n\\nYou can have one of these.", "Olá, Como se chama? hein?\\n\\nSim...\\nQue nome mais lindo.\\n\\nBem, eu me chamo KIRI.\\n\\nMeus pais me chamava assim porque\\ndesejava que fosse doce e afetuosa.\\n\\nAssim queriam e assim eu sou.\\n\\nAqui toma! leve isso."},
  {"g3:082a7c7c", "KIRI will give you this BERRY, too!\\nI really like it lots!", "Vou te dar esse FRUTO, também.\\nEu gosto muito desse."},
  {"g3:082a7cb7", "I wonder what kind of wish is included\\nin your name.", "Eu queria saber que tipo de desejo\\ntem em seu nome."},
  {"g3:082a7cec", "Spring, summer, autumn, and winter.\\n\\nIf you're born in springtime, do you like\\nthe spring, and if you're born in the\\n\\nsummer, do you like the summer?", "Primavera, verÃo, outono e inverno.\\n\\nAcredita que se nascer na primavera\\nvocê gosta mais dessa estaçÃo e se\\n\\nnascer no verÃo prefere o verÃo?"},
  {"g3:082a7d80", "Then KIRI was born in the autumn,\\nso I love the autumn!\\n\\nWhich season do you like?", "Pois eu nasci no outono,\\npor isso eu amo o outono!\\n\\nDe qual estaçÃo você gosta?"},
  {"g3:082a7dd2", "Oh...\\nIt doesn't matter...\\n\\nThere's so much that I want to know...", "Oh...\\nBem, nÃo importa...\\n\\nHá tantas coisas que eu quero saber..."},
  {"g3:082a7e0e", "Are you planning on going deep\\nin there?\\n\\nHow about bringing me back some\\nSHOAL SALT and SHOAL SHELLS?\\n\\nI can make you something good if\\nyou bring me the ingredients.", "Está pensando em chegar\\naté o fundo?\\n\\nPor que você nÃo me traz\\nSAL FINO e CONCHA RASA?\\n\\nEu posso te fazer algo muito especial\\nse trouxer esses 2 ingredientes."},
  {"g3:082a7eb3", "If you bring me four each of the\\nSHOAL SALT and SHOAL SHELLS,\\n\\nI can make you a SHELL BELL...\\n\\nYou can get those ingredients\\nevery day.", "Preciso de SAL FINO e CONCHA RASA.\\nCom 4 de cada um, posso\\n\\nfazer 1 CASTANHOLA...\\n\\nEsses ingredientes você poderá\\nobter todos os dias."},
  {"g3:082a7f37", "Oh, hey! SHOAL SALT and SHOAL SHELLS!\\nAnd enough of them, too!\\n\\nWould you like me to make you\\na SHELL BELL with them?", "Oh, veja só! SAL FINO e CONCHA RASA,\\nacho que já tem bastante, também!\\n\\nQuer que eu te faça uma\\nCASTANHOLA com eles?"},
  {"g3:082a7fac", "All righty, then! I'll make you\\na SHELL BELL right away.\\n\\n... ... ... ... ... ... ... ...\\n... ... ... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nThere! Done!", "Tudo bem, entÃo. Eu vou fazer\\numa CASTANHOLA agora mesmo.\\n\\n... ... ... ... ... ... ... \\n... ... ... ... ... ... ...  \\n\\nAqui! Feito!"},
  {"g3:082a8012", "Have a POKéMON hold on to that.\\nIt'll love it, that's for certain.\\n\\nWhy, the SHELL BELL's chime...\\nIt's simply sublime!\\n\\nYou can get its ingredients every day,\\nso I can make you more.", "Dê para um POKéMON segurar.\\nEle vai adorar, isso é certo.\\n\\nPor que, o som da CASTANHOLA...\\nAh... É sublime!\\n\\nPoderá obter os ingredientes a cada\\ndia, retorne e eu posso te fazer mais."},
  {"g3:082a80c6", "Oh... Is that so...\\nI wanted to make a SHELL BELL...", "Oh... É isso mesmo...\\nEu queria fazer CASTANHOLA..."},
  {"g3:082a80f5", "You don't have space in your BAG\\nif I were to make it for you.\\n\\nYou should make room and come back\\nfor a SHELL BELL.", "You don't have space in your BAG\\nif I were to make it for you.\\n\\nYou should make room and come back\\nfor a SHELL BELL."},
  {"g3:082a8169", "There was some SHOAL SALT here.\\nBut, there's nothing here now.", "Aqui havia algum SAL FINO,\\nmas agora nÃo há mais nada."},
  {"g3:082a81a8", "There was a SHOAL SHELL here.\\nBut, there's nothing here now.", "Aqui havia uma CONCHA RASA,\\nmas agora nÃo há mais nada."},
